# Run folders, logs, exports and aggregations are committed byte for byte: the run records hold
# SHA-256 digests of these files, and `aspire record verify` recomputes them. Git
# must therefore never convert line endings here (core.autocrlf would change the bytes of files
# written on Windows, including files that the agent wrote in its working directory). The
# harness itself writes LF on every platform.
* -text
